{"id":"wb-7-1304","name":"广安白塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"廣安白塔","text":"广安白塔位于四川省广安市广安区，文物遗址年代判定为宋。1980年7月7日列为四川省重新确定公布的第一批省级文物保护单位。2013年3月5日公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BB%A3%E5%AE%89%E7%99%BD%E5%A1%94","revisionId":95424440,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95424440","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/bbfb4ecf0e978721611cf598.jpg","title":"广安白塔照片.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%B9%BF%E5%AE%89%E7%99%BD%E5%A1%94%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/20/%E5%B9%BF%E5%AE%89%E7%99%BD%E5%A1%94%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​广安白塔","width":320,"height":373}}